00:05:00,000 --> 00:05:06,000
Get Ready for Ricki.

2
00:10:00,000 --> 00:10:06,000
Ricki and the Flash is a comedy, drama, music film directed by Jonathan Demme.

3
00:15:00,000 --> 00:15:06,000
Meryl Streep stars as Ricki Rendazzo, a guitar heroine who made a world of
mistakes as she followed her dreams of rock-and-roll stardom.

4
00:20:00,000 --> 00:20:06,000
Returning home, Ricki gets a shot at redemption and a chance to make
things right as she faces the music with her family.

5
00:25:00,000 --> 00:25:06,000
Ricki Rendazzo, played by Meryl Streep.

6
00:30:00,000 --> 00:30:06,000
Pete Brummel, played by Kevin Kline.

7
00:35:00,000 --> 00:35:06,000
Julie Brummel, played by Mamie Gummer.

8
