10
00:50:00,000 --> 00:50:06,000
Daniel, played by Ben Platt.

11
00:55:00,000 --> 00:55:06,000
Ricki and the Flash is a 2015 American musical comedy-drama film directed by Jonathan Demme and written by Diablo
Cody, about a woman who leaves her family to become a rock star and later gets a chance to make amends.

12
01:00:00,000 --> 01:00:06,000
The film stars Meryl Streep, Mamie Gummer, Kevin Kline,
Sebastian Stan, Rick Springfield, and Audra McDonald.

13
01:05:00,000 --> 01:05:06,000
The film marks Streep and Kline's third collaboration after Sophie's
Choice (1982) and A Prairie Home Companion (2006).

14
01:10:00,000 --> 01:10:06,000
It was Demme's final narrative film before his death in April 2017.

15
01:15:00,000 --> 01:15:06,000
Principal photography began on October 13, 2014, in Rye, New York.

16
01:20:00,000 --> 01:20:06,000
TriStar Pictures financed, and released the film on August 7, 2015.

17
01:25:00,000 --> 01:25:06,000
The film received mixed reviews from critics, who praised the performances of the cast but criticised its
screenplay and execution, and grossed $41 million against its $18–30 million production budget.

18
01:30:00,000 --> 01:30:06,000
The film explores themes of rock star, homophobia,
aging, family relationships, divorce.

19
01:35:00,000 --> 01:35:06,000
The tone is lighthearted and emotional.
